              "the mechanism of adaptation changes"


## CTC transition

The difference between ordinary adaptation and recursive adaptation is not whether a system changes.

Both systems change.

The difference is whether information from reality can change the mechanism that generates future changes.

\[
\Omega_t \rightarrow \Delta\mathcal{G}_{t+1}
\]

CTC marks this transition.
